Bottom Line
The most consequential change is HCA=E2=80=99s quantification of a $400 milli=
on pre-tax hit from Exchange coverage loss, establishing that eligibility att=
rition can overwhelm otherwise healthy provider demand. Coverage-driven uncom=
pensated care and claims-migration controls require the closest attention. Th=
